# Redis 配置模板

## 连接配置

```json
{
  "name": "redis",
  "description": "Redis 配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "database": "redis",
  "config": {
    "host": "localhost",
    "port": 6379,
    "password": "${REDIS_PASSWORD}",
    "db": 0,
    "keyPrefix": "myapp:",
    "tls": false
  },
  "connectionString": "redis://:password@host:6379/0",
  "cliTools": ["redis-cli"],
  "setup": {
    "install": "brew install redis",
    "start": "brew services start redis",
    "connect": "redis-cli"
  },
  "envVars": {
    "REDIS_HOST": "localhost",
    "REDIS_PORT": "6379",
    "REDIS_PASSWORD": ""
  },
  "features": [
    "键值存储",
    "发布/订阅",
    "Lua 脚本",
    "事务",
    "过期机制"
  ]
}
```

## 连接示例

```bash
# 连接 Redis
redis-cli

# 带密码连接
redis-cli -a your_password

# 连接指定数据库
redis-cli -n 1
```

## 常用命令

```bash
# 基本操作
SET key value
GET key
DEL key

# 哈希
HSET user name "张三"
HGETALL user

# 列表
LPUSH queue task1
RPOP queue

# 发布/订阅
PUBLISH channel message
SUBSCRIBE channel

# 监控
MONITOR

# 查看所有键
KEYS *

# 查看服务器信息
INFO
```

## 文件位置
`templates/database/redis-config.json`
